  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/strike-body-life-soul-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you attempt to bind a Large or smaller creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw or have its Speed reduced to 0, and be unable to take Reactions, until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The curse can affect a creature of any size, and it lasts for 1 minute. The cursed creature repeats the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself on a success.</p>",
